  },
  {
   "title": "vPC-SVI",
   "text": "Logical Interface Profile mit OSPF Interface Profile (Policy OSPF-BFD) und BFD Interface Profile. Interface: **SVI**, Pfadtyp **Virtual Port Channel** IPG-vPC-core, **vlan-350**, MTU **1500**, Side A 172.16.50.1/29, Side B 172.16.50.2/29, Secondary 172.16.50.3/29.",
