 "solution": "`{\"fvTenant\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Shop\"}, \"children\": [{\"ospfIfPol\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"OSPF-BFD\", \"nwT\": \"bcast\", \"ctrl\": \"bfd\"}}}, {\"vzBrCP\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"web-to-campus\", \"scope\": \"context\"}, \"children\": [{\"vzSubj\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"subj\", \"revFltPorts\": \"yes\"}, \"children\": [{\"vzRsSubjFiltAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnVzFilterName\": \"icmp\"}}}]}}]}}, {\"fvBD\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"BD-Web\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsCtx\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvCtxName\": \"Prod\"}}}, {\"fvSubnet\": {\"attributes\": {\"ip\": \"10.10.10.1/24\", \"scope\": \"public\"}}}, {\"fvRsBDToOut\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnL3extOutName\": \"Core\"}}}]}}, {\"fvAp\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Webshop\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvAEPg\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Web\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsCons\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnVzBrCPName\": \"web-to-campus\"}}}]}}]}}, {\"l3extOut\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Core\"}, \"children\": [{\"l3extRsEctx\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvCtxName\": \"Prod\"}}}, {\"l3extRsL3DomAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"uni/l3dom-L3Dom-Core\"}}}, {\"ospfExtP\": {\"attributes\": {\"areaId\": \"0.0.0.1\"}}}, {\"l3extLNodeP\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"border\"}, \"children\": [{\"l3extRsNodeL3OutAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"topology/pod-1/node-103\", \"rtrId\": \"1.1.1.103\"}}}, {\"l3extRsNodeL3OutAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"topology/pod-1/node-104\", \"rtrId\": \"1.1.1.104\"}}}, {\"l3extLIfP\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"vpc-svi\"}, \"children\": [{\"ospfIfP\": {\"attributes\": {}, \"children\": [{\"ospfRsIfPol\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnOspfIfPolName\": \"OSPF-BFD\"}}}]}}, {\"bfdIfP\": {\"attributes\": {}}}, {\"l3extRsPathL3OutAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"topology/pod-1/protpaths-103-104/pathep-[IPG-vPC-core]\", \"ifInstT\": \"ext-svi\", \"encap\": \"vlan-350\", \"mtu\": \"1500\"}, \"children\": [{\"l3extMember\": {\"attributes\": {\"side\": \"A\", \"addr\": \"172.16.50.1/29\"}, \"children\": [{\"l3extIp\": {\"attributes\": {\"addr\": \"172.16.50.3/29\"}}}]}}, {\"l3extMember\": {\"attributes\": {\"side\": \"B\", \"addr\": \"172.16.50.2/29\"}, \"children\": [{\"l3extIp\": {\"attributes\": {\"addr\": \"172.16.50.3/29\"}}}]}}]}}]}}]}}, {\"l3extInstP\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Campus\"}, \"children\": [{\"l3extSubnet\": {\"attributes\": {\"ip\": \"10.200.0.0/16\"}}}, {\"fvRsProv\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnVzBrCPName\": \"web-to-campus\"}}}]}}]}}]}}`\\n\\nBei einem SVI auf einem vPC bekommt jeder Leaf seine Primary IP (Side A/B), die Secondary IP ist auf beiden aktiv. BFD läuft nur, wenn es im Protokoll (OSPF Interface Policy *BFD*) und auf dem Router aktiviert ist.",
